("ModuleCard frame","design anatomy","Panel","molecule","ui","—","Surface","extraer","Draft v0.1 only: static host-agnostic Header/Body/Footer composition, default/banded variants and explicit frame ownership. Popover #96, Dialog #119 or a page own opening/semantics. Contract: [#180](https://github.com/egdev6/egdev-design-system/issues/180), [local draft](components/panel/v0.1/spec.md)."),
