("SearchTrigger","molécula","SearchTrigger","atom","ui","—","Icon, Kbd, Surface","mantener","Implemented React atom under [approved v0.2 contract](https://github.com/egdev6/egdev-design-system/issues/99): native type=button launcher on the Surface well recipe with a decorative 16px search Icon, visible label that is also the accessible name and an optional aria-hidden Kbd hint; compact keeps the name. Native onClick and forwarded ref let a host Dialog Trigger wrap it; the host owns the palette, shortcut binding and focus. Button is not composed (D1). Keeps eg-search; no stylesheet."),
("SocialLinks","molécula","SocialLinks","molecule","ui","—","IconButton, Cluster","mantener",""),
("PhotoFrame","molécula","PhotoFrame","atom","ui","AspectRatio","—","mantener","Approved six-row catalogue correction: one framed-image concept; AspectRatio is a supporting primitive. See [classification rules](CATALOGACION.md). API unchanged; no implementation implied."),
("PullQuote","molécula","PullQuote","atom","ui","—","—","mantener","Implemented React atom under [approved v0.2 contract](https://github.com/egdev6/egdev-design-system/issues/98): native figure > blockquote > p with an optional figcaption source outside the passage. Pull (brand logical-start filet, 40ch measure) or display (uppercase display scale, block accent); both stay quotations, never headings. Plain-string text/accent/source, native cite on the blockquote only, raised tone changes the accent only. Quote typography and measure tokens; no Text composition (D2), Radix, ref or stylesheet."),
("Countdown","molécula","Countdown","atom","ui","—","—","mantener","Implemented React atom under [approved v0.2 contract](https://github.com/egdev6/egdev-design-system/issues/82): passive role=timer readout (aria-live=off) of days/hours/minutes/seconds to a Unix-ms deadline, with readable deadlineText in a native time element. Deterministic SSR initializing text, client-only clock sampling, ceil rounding, latched expiry and onExpire once per deadline episode. Native elements with token recipes (`text-countdown-md/sm`, countdown spacing); Text is not composed (D11). No Radix, stylesheet, ref or asChild."),
